---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Cake Portfolio | Custom Cake Designs by PureBakes Hyderabad
description: Explore hundreds of real custom cake designs created by PureBakes in Hyderabad, with search and filters for occasions and themes.
pageType: gallery
pageSlug: gallery
canonical: https://purebakes.in/gallery/
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: Home, url: / }
  - { label: Cake Portfolio }
---

<header class="page-hero wrap gallery-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Real PureBakes creations</p>
  <h1>Explore Our<br><em>Cake Portfolio</em></h1>
  <p>Discover {{ gallery.length }} real PureBakes cake designs for birthdays, weddings, engagements and celebrations across Hyderabad.</p>
</header>

<section class="gallery-experience wrap section" data-gallery>

  <form class="gallery-search gallery-discovery" role="search" data-gallery-search-form>
    <div class="gallery-search-field">
      <label class="sr-only" for="gallery-search">Search cake designs</label>

      <input
        id="gallery-search"
        type="search"
        placeholder="Try butterfly, jungle, birthday…"
        autocomplete="off"
        maxlength="100"
        data-gallery-search
      >

      <button
        class="gallery-search-clear"
        type="button"
        aria-label="Clear search"
        data-gallery-search-clear
        hidden
      >×</button>
    </div>

    <button
      class="button button--primary gallery-explore-button"
      type="button"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls="gallery-explore"
      data-gallery-explore
    >Explore</button>
  </form>

  <section
    class="gallery-explore"
    id="gallery-explore"
    aria-label="Explore cake designs"
    data-gallery-explore-panel
    hidden
  >
    <div class="gallery-pill-group">
      <h2>Occasion</h2>

      <div class="gallery-pills">
        {% for item in galleryDiscovery.occasions %}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="gallery-pill"
            data-gallery-pill
            data-filter-type="{{ item.field }}"
            data-filter-key="{{ item.key }}"
            data-filter-value="{{ item.value }}"
            aria-pressed="{% if item.key == 'all' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
          >{{ item.label }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-pill-group">
      <h2>Theme</h2>

      <div class="gallery-pills">
        {% for item in galleryDiscovery.themes %}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="gallery-pill"
            data-gallery-pill
            data-filter-type="{{ item.field }}"
            data-filter-key="{{ item.key }}"
            data-filter-value="{{ item.value }}"
            aria-pressed="false"
          >{{ item.label }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gallery-status" aria-live="polite">
    <strong data-gallery-result-heading>{{ gallery.length }} cake designs</strong>

    <button
      class="text-link"
      type="button"
      data-gallery-clear
      data-gallery-clear-status
      hidden
    >View all cakes</button>
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-grid" data-gallery-grid>
    {% for cake in gallery %}
      {% if loop.index <= 30 %}
        <article class="gallery-card" data-cake-id="{{ cake.id }}">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-gallery-open="{{ cake.id }}"
            data-gallery-action="image_open"
            data-cake-id="{{ cake.id }}"
            aria-label="View {{ cake.caption }}"
          >
            <img
              class="portfolio-cake-photo"
              src="{{ cake.image | imageVariant(360) }}"
              srcset="{{ cake.image | imageVariant(360) }} 360w, {{ cake.image | imageVariant(720) }} 720w"
              sizes="(max-width: 47.99rem) calc(50vw - 1.2rem), (max-width: 74.99rem) calc(33.333vw - 1.5rem), calc(20vw - 1.5rem)"
              width="1080"
              height="1920"
              alt="{{ cake.alt }}"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            >

            <span>
              <small>
                {% if cake.occasions.length %}
                  {{ occasions[cake.occasions[0]].name }}
                {% else %}
                  Custom design
                {% endif %}
              </small>

              <strong>{{ cake.caption }}</strong>
            </span>
          </button>
        </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div
    class="gallery-sentinel"
    data-gallery-sentinel
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="gallery-empty" data-gallery-empty hidden>
    <h2 data-gallery-empty-heading>No matching cake designs found.</h2>
    <p>Try another search or return to the complete PureBakes portfolio.</p>

    <button
      class="button button--primary"
      type="button"
      data-gallery-clear
    >View all cakes</button>
  </div>

</section>

<section class="section gallery-seo">
  <div class="wrap compact-split">
    <h2>Real custom cake designs from our Hyderabad studio</h2>

    <div>
      <p>This portfolio brings together real PureBakes work across first birthdays, milestone birthdays, anniversaries, engagements, weddings, baby celebrations and more. Each cake is made to order rather than selected from a fixed ecommerce catalogue.</p>

      <p>Found a useful reference? Open the design and check your date. We can adapt colours, scale and finishing details around your celebration while keeping the final cake personal to you.</p>

      <p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/cakes/">Explore cakes by celebration →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<dialog
  class="cake-dialog"
  data-cake-dialog
  aria-labelledby="cake-dialog-title"
>
  <button
    class="cake-dialog-close"
    type="button"
    data-cake-dialog-close
    aria-label="Close cake detail"
  >×</button>

  <div
    class="cake-dialog-media"
    data-cake-dialog-media
  >
    <button
      class="cake-dialog-nav cake-dialog-nav--prev"
      type="button"
      data-cake-dialog-prev
      aria-label="View previous cake"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">←</span>
    </button>

    <img
      data-cake-dialog-image
      width="600"
      height="760"
      alt=""
    >

    <button
      class="cake-dialog-nav cake-dialog-nav--next"
      type="button"
      data-cake-dialog-next
      aria-label="View next cake"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="cake-dialog-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-cake-dialog-context>PureBakes creation</p>

    <h2
      id="cake-dialog-title"
      data-cake-dialog-caption
    ></h2>

    <button
      class="button button--gold"
      data-availability-open
      data-cta-location="gallery_detail"
      data-cake-context
    >Check availability</button>
  </div>
</dialog>

<script
  type="application/json"
  id="gallery-data"
>{{ gallery | galleryClientData | json | safe }}</script>

<script
  type="application/json"
  id="gallery-discovery-data"
>{{ galleryDiscovery | json | safe }}</script>

<script src="/assets/js/gallery.js" type="module"></script>